    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61365" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωπ-έω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωπ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>furnish
				with oars</i>, in pf.
			
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκώπηται ἡ ναῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			: pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκώπηνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1604.73
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>furnish with handles</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῦφα κεκωπημένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					1143.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			= foreg. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκώπηται</span>
			.</div>
